Lost & Found Platform – Prompt

You are a  UI/UX Designer, and College Student preparing a hackathon presentation.

Task

Design a modern Lost & Found Platform for Amity University Madhya Pradesh and create the following deliverables:

1. A professional Lost Item Report Poster.
2. A PowerPoint presentation explaining the platform.
3. A responsive HTML/CSS prototype of the poster page.
4. A GitHub README.md file documenting the project.

Project Context

Amity University Madhya Pradesh has launched a Lost & Found Platform to help students report, search, and recover lost items on campus.

Requirements for the Poster

- Highlight the lost item image prominently.
- Include an item details section:
  - Item Name
  - Description
  - Location Lost
  - Date Lost
  - Category
- Include a clear contact information section.
- Use professional college branding.
- Mobile-friendly and responsive layout.
- Modern, clean, and visually attractive design.
- Add a call-to-action encouraging students to report or search for lost items.

College Information

- College Name: Amity University Madhya Pradesh
- Presenter Name: Varma Pradeep
- Branch: B.Tech (CSE)

